{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "右", "id": "右"}, {"form": "司", "id": "司"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "左", "id": "左"}, {"form": "日", "id": "日"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "舍", "id": "舍"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 4.314149212270796, "source": "右", "target": "左"}, {"weight": 2.23470767059096, "source": "右", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.810071815494522, "source": "出", "target": "舍"}, {"weight": 2.299246191728531, "source": "出", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.810071815494522, "source": "出", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 2.810071815494522, "source": "出", "target": "司"}, {"weight": 0.7731898882334817, "source": "出", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.810071815494522, "source": "出", "target": "日"}, {"weight": 3.9086841041626315, "source": "出", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.8292425624827955, "source": "出", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.1786549963416462, "source": "先", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.23470767059096, "source": "先", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.23470767059096, "source": "左", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.1786549963416462, "source": "君", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "君", "target": "司"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "君", "target": "日"}, {"weight": 1.0245043165143877, "source": "君", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 1.5573088469991538, "source": "諸", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.423777454374631, "source": "諸", "